@host = https://localhost:7123

### 1. Registrar
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/Registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Evans", "correo": "tucorreo@gmail.com", "contrasena": "123456" }

### 2. Verificar el código (el que te llegó al correo)
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/VerificarCorreo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "correo": "tucorreo@gmail.com", "codigo": "000000" }

### 3. Login
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "correo": "Evans", "contrasena": "123456" }